efficient build system) instead of Make |\n\n## Configuration Flags\n\n```bash\n-DCMAKE_BUILD_TYPE=Release\n```\nOptimized build (enables `-O2/-O3` optimization, strips debug symbols).\n\n```bash\n-DCMAKE_INSTALL_PREFIX=/usr -DCMAKE_INSTALL_LIB"}